        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in industrial furnace 1MW
Inventory for 1 MJ natural gas, burned in an industrial furnace with a capacity of 1 MW with 5000 operating hours;
UUID: 045e458d-5776-3c92-82ff-274665aaa4fc
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (furnace), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland.
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_045e458d-5776-3c92-82ff-274665aaa4fc.xml</text>
